OL,15,G0232FTech Life
OL,16,     GWhen we fly we love to take our
OL,17,     Ggadgets with us. But the lithium
OL,18,     Gbatteries that power them can
OL,19,     Gcatch fire. We find out about a
OL,20,     Gnew campaign urging us to pack
OL,21,     Gwith safety in mind.
